Package: depot-capslock
Version: 1.0.1
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-gi, python3-gi-cairo, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-pango-1.0
Recommends: fonts-inter
Maintainer: nguyenquocanhz <nguyenquocanhz@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/nguyenquocanhz/depot-os
Description: on-screen Caps Lock indicator from Depot OS
 Shows a small rounded box with a padlock for a second each time Caps Lock
 is switched: closed padlock and "A" when on, open padlock and "a" when off.
 .
 The box is drawn with cairo (no icon theme needed), never takes keyboard
 focus and lets mouse clicks through. It starts with the desktop session
 and works on any X11 desktop: XFCE, MATE, Cinnamon, LXQt, i3, Openbox.
 .
 Ô báo Caps Lock của Depot OS đóng thành gói riêng: ổ khoá đóng + chữ A khi
 bật, ổ khoá mở + chữ a khi tắt. Trên Depot OS ô báo này đã có sẵn trong
 depot-notify nên gói tự nhường, không hiện hai lần.
